# Gugu — AI Mental Wellness Companion: Complete Codebase Report

> **Total Lines of Code**: ~4,410 across all source files
> **Project Type**: Full-stack web app (React SPA + Cloudflare Workers API)
> **Date**: 30 March 2026

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Frontend["Frontend (Vite + React 19)"]
        UI["React SPA<br/>localhost:3000"]
        HF["huggingFaceService.ts<br/>(AI Chat)"]
        Auth["AuthContext<br/>(JWT + localStorage)"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend (Hono on Cloudflare Workers)"]
        API["REST API<br/>gugu-backend.revastra.workers.dev"]
        D1["Cloudflare D1<br/>SQLite Database"]
        JWT["JWT Auth<br/>(jose + PBKDF2)"]
    end

    subgraph External["External Services"]
        HFAPI["Hugging Face<br/>router.huggingface.co"]
        Vercel["Vercel<br/>(Frontend Hosting)"]
    end

    UI --> HF --> HFAPI
    UI --> Auth --> API
    API --> JWT
    API --> D1
    UI -.-> Vercel
```

