| **Runtime** | Cloudflare Workers | — | Serverless edge compute |
| **Database** | Cloudflare D1 (SQLite) | — | Persistent storage |
| **Auth** | jose + Web Crypto PBKDF2 | 5.6.0 | JWT tokens + password hashing |
| **Frontend Hosting** | Vercel | — | Static site deployment |

