### 4.2 API Routes (22 endpoints)

#### Authentication
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | ❌ | Register new user (patient/therapist) |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | ❌ | Login, returns JWT |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | ✅ | Get current user info |

#### Patient Features
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
|--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/dashboard` | ✅ | Patient | Returns hardcoded stats + mock mood history |
| POST | `/api/summaries` | ✅ | Patient | Save AI-generated escalation summary |
| POST | `/api/therapy-requests` | ✅ | Any | Create therapy request (AI matching) |
| GET | `/api/therapy-requests/my` | ✅ | Any | Get user's therapy requests |
| GET | `/api/appointments/patient` | ✅ | Patient | Get patient's appointments |

#### Therapist Features
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
|--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/summaries` | ✅ | Therapist | View all patient escalations |
| PATCH | `/api/summaries/:id/status` | ✅ | Therapist | Update escalation status |
| GET | `/api/patients` | ✅ | Therapist | List assigned patients |
| GET | `/api/therapists` | ✅ | Any | List all therapists |
| GET/POST | `/api/notes` | ✅ | Therapist | CRUD clinical notes |
| DELETE | `/api/notes/:id` | ✅ | Therapist | Delete a note |
| GET/POST | `/api/appointments` | ✅ | Therapist | CRUD appointments |
| PATCH/DELETE | `/api/appointments/:id` | ✅ | Therapist | Update/delete appointments |
| GET/POST | `/api/therapist/profile` | ✅ | Therapist | Profile management |
| GET | `/api/therapy-requests/pending` | ✅ | Any | View pending requests |
| PATCH | `/api/therapy-requests/:id/approve` | ✅ | Therapist | Approve a request |
| PATCH | `/api/therapy-requests/:id/reject` | ✅ | Therapist | Reject a request |
| PATCH | `/api/therapy-requests/:id/schedule` | ✅ | Therapist | Schedule a session |

### 4.3 Database Schema (7 tables)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    users {
        int id PK
        text name
        text email UK
        text password_hash
        text role "patient | therapist"
    }
    mood_logs {
        int id PK
        int user_id FK
        int score "1-5"
        datetime timestamp
    }
    patient_summaries {
        int id PK
        int patient_id FK
        text summary
        text severity
        text status "pending | in-progress | resolved"
        text conversation_snippet
    }
    notes {
        int id PK
        int therapist_id FK
        text title
        text content
    }
    appointments {
        int id PK
        int therapist_id FK
        text patient_name
        text date
        text time
        text type
    }
    therapist_profiles {
        int therapist_id PK
        int hourly_rate
        text bio
        text specialties
    }
    therapy_requests {
        int id PK
        int patient_id FK
        text patient_name
        text ai_summary
        text domain
        text severity
        text status "pending | approved | scheduled | completed | rejected"
        int therapist_id FK
    }

    users ||--o{ mood_logs : logs
    users ||--o{ patient_summaries : creates
    users ||--o{ notes : writes
    users ||--o{ appointments : has
    users ||--o| therapist_profiles : has
    users ||--o{ therapy_requests : creates
```

### 4.4 Authentication Flow

1. **Password hashing**: PBKDF2 with 100,000 iterations, SHA-256, 16-byte random salt
2. **JWT**: HS256 algorithm, 24-hour expiry via `jose` library
3. **Storage**: Token + user object stored in browser `localStorage`
4. **Middleware**: [authMiddleware](file:///home/kv/Desktop/Copy-of-Gugu---AI-Mental-Wellness/backend/src/index.ts#30-42) verifies JWT on every protected route

