## 5. AI Chat Pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Chat.tsx
    participant HFService
    participant HuggingFace

    User->>Chat.tsx: Types message
    Chat.tsx->>HFService: sendMessageToHF(history, message)
    HFService->>HuggingFace: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(system prompt + history + message)
    HuggingFace-->>HFService: JSON response
    HFService-->>Chat.tsx: Parsed GeminiResponse
    
    alt isOutOfControl = true
        Chat.tsx->>Backend: POST /api/summaries (crisis)
        Chat.tsx->>Backend: POST /api/therapy-requests (auto-refer)
    else shouldRefer = true
        Chat.tsx->>User: Ask for consent
        User->>Chat.tsx: "yes"
        Chat.tsx->>Backend: POST /api/therapy-requests
    end
```

**AI Model**: `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct` via `router.huggingface.co/v1/chat/completions`

**System Prompt** instructs the model to:
- Respond as "Gugu" — a warm, empathetic companion
- Use CBT, DBT, and Motivational Interviewing techniques subtly
- Return **structured JSON** with `response`, `isOutOfControl`, `shouldRefer`, `domain`, `therapistSummary`
- Trigger crisis protocol for self-harm/suicide signals

