## 9. Known Issues & Observations

> [!WARNING]
> **Security**: The `JWT_SECRET` is hardcoded in [wrangler.toml](file:///home/kv/Desktop/Copy-of-Gugu---AI-Mental-Wellness/backend/wrangler.toml) (`gugu-secret-key-123!@#`). This should be moved to Cloudflare Workers Secrets.

> [!WARNING]
> **Security**: The HF API key is exposed in the frontend [.env](file:///home/kv/Desktop/Copy-of-Gugu---AI-Mental-Wellness/frontend/.env) and sent directly from the browser. This should be proxied through the backend to prevent key exposure.

> [!NOTE]
> **Dashboard**: The `/api/dashboard` endpoint returns **hardcoded mock data** (not real mood history from the `mood_logs` table). The mood_logs table exists in the schema but is never written to.

> [!NOTE]
> **Dashboard Loading**: The dashboard gets stuck on "Loading dashboard..." if the backend API call fails (network error, expired token, or CORS issue). The error is silently caught — no user-facing error message is shown.

> [!NOTE]
> **Legacy Code**: [geminiService.ts](file:///home/kv/Desktop/Copy-of-Gugu---AI-Mental-Wellness/frontend/services/geminiService.ts) and `@google/genai` dependency still exist in the codebase but are no longer used since the switch to Hugging Face.

> [!NOTE]
> **Meeting Room**: The video call functionality in [MeetingRoom.tsx](file:///home/kv/Desktop/Copy-of-Gugu---AI-Mental-Wellness/frontend/pages/MeetingRoom.tsx) uses `socket.io-client` but appears to be simulated (no real WebRTC/signaling server configured).
